OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786996104
OL,3,CPetition to stop early release of PC
OL,4,CHarper's killers hits a million
OL,5,Csignatures
OL,7,FTwo out of three of PC Harper's
OL,8,Fkillers, Albert Bowers and Jessie
OL,9,FCole, are set to be released next year
OL,10,Fhalfway through their 13-year
OL,11,Fsentences under Government plans for
OL,12,Fearly releases designed to tackle
OL,13,Fovercrowding in jails.
OL,15,FThe prospect of their release has
OL,16,Fprompted widespread condemnation of
OL,17,Fthe scheme in which some 5,000 people
OL,18,Fare expected to be released early
OL,19,Funder sentencing changes, down from
OL,20,F6,000 after ministers exempted rapists
OL,21,Fand "serious" child sex offenders.
OL,26,@}D@EOU}D@MO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/9
