CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786996104
OL,3,CPetition to stop early release of PC
OL,4,CHarper's killers hits a million
OL,5,Csignatures
OL,7,FAs of Friday morning, (14 August) the
OL,8,Fonline petition set up by Aileen
OL,9,FO'Connor, chairwoman of Thames Valley
OL,10,FPolice Federation, had reached more
OL,11,Fthan one million signatures.
OL,13,FIt comes after Prime Minister Andy
OL,14,FBurnham said this week that he
OL,15,F"wouldn't forgive myself" if he did
OL,16,Fnot try to lessen the "anguish" of the
OL,17,Fofficer's family.
OL,26,@wD@AOUwD@YO]xD@WOUxD@_O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786996104
OL,3,CPetition to stop early release of PC
OL,4,CHarper's killers hits a million
OL,5,Csignatures
OL,7,FIn an interview with LBC, Mr Burnham
OL,8,Fwas asked if he had a message for
OL,9,FAimee Harper, the sister of the PC
OL,10,FHarper, and who had shared with the
OL,11,Fbroadcaster her experience of sitting
OL,12,Fin the courtroom with his killers.
OL,14,FAsked what he would directly say to Ms
OL,15,FHarper, Mr Burnham replied: "That I
OL,16,Fhear you, I feel for you. I wouldn't
OL,17,Fforgive myself if I didn't do
OL,18,Feverything I possibly could to try and
OL,19,Flessen your anguish, and I am doing
OL,20,Fthat.
OL,26,@wD@]OU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786996104
OL,3,CPetition to stop early release of PC
OL,4,CHarper's killers hits a million
OL,5,Csignatures
OL,7,F"I am turning over every stone. I am
OL,8,Flooking at everything. I am pushing
OL,9,Fthe system to go further."
OL,11,FMr Burnham has ordered Justice
OL,12,FSecretary Alex Norris to draw up plans
OL,13,Fto free up prison space for serious
OL,14,Foffenders, and said he is
OL,15,F"increasingly confident" PC Harper's
OL,16,Fkillers will not be released early
OL,17,Ffrom their sentences as a result.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@ZO]wD@AOUwD@XO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/9
