PN,38106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786996104
OL,3,CPetition to stop early release of PC
OL,4,CHarper's killers hits a million
OL,5,Csignatures
OL,7,FThe Prime Minister has come under
OL,8,Fpressure from 50 policing leaders from
OL,9,Facross the UK to use "every lawful
OL,10,Foption" to prevent the early release
OL,11,Fof Cole and Bowers.
OL,13,FA letter from chief constables and
OL,14,Fother law enforcement leaders also
OL,15,Fcalled on the Prime Minister to
OL,16,F"establish an additional public
OL,17,Fprotection safeguard" for the most
OL,18,Fserious offenders, when future early
OL,19,Frelease schemes are floated.
OL,26,@qD@VOUrD@GO]xD@AOUyD@UO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
