OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786996104
OL,3,CPetition to stop early release of PC
OL,4,CHarper's killers hits a million
OL,5,Csignatures
OL,7,FThe Prime Minister ordered a review of
OL,8,Fthe early release scheme under the
OL,9,FSentencing Act shortly after taking
OL,10,Foffice, but while changes were
OL,11,Fannounced to prevent rapists and
OL,12,Fpaedophiles being released early the
OL,13,Fmeasures did not cover Pc Harper's
OL,14,Fkillers.
OL,16,FBefore this year's Sentencing Act,
OL,17,Fthey would have served two-thirds of
OL,18,Ftheir term.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786996104
OL,3,CPetition to stop early release of PC
OL,4,CHarper's killers hits a million
OL,5,Csignatures
OL,7,FMr Burnham previously said he had
OL,8,F"pushed the very limits" in the
OL,9,Fchanges he had made to the early
OL,10,Frelease scheme, but has now said he
OL,11,Fcan go further.
OL,13,FIn a statement, Thames Valley Police
OL,14,FFederation said: "We would like to
OL,15,Fthank each and every person who has
OL,16,Fsigned our petition for their support
OL,17,Fon this important issue."
OL,26,@pD@AOUpD@XO]vD@ROU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/9
